110: // Capacity of the per-stroke StrokePath ring buffer. STROKE_CURVED projects
111: // onto at most this many recent dab centers; 64 covers a long stroke at the
112: // default spacing without an allocation. Mirrored as the WGSL storage-buffer
113: // length bound by the (future) dispatcher.
114: inline constexpr int kStrokePathMax = 64;
